&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;Learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;fortidlp-input-element-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a 12-week internship during summer 2027.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join the Acceleration Programs team within the Talent Density pillar of our People Team, which works to cultivate a culture that attracts, recognizes, and accelerates top talent. As an intern, you&#39;ll align with one or more critical projects that support our number one operating priority: top talent in every seat. You&#39;ll flex program design, project management, and analytical skills while contributing to work that unlocks employees&#39; ability to have a major impact at Coinbase.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support program design by actively contributing to brainstorms, working sessions, and development of project plans, timelines, and deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Talent Density team members and cross-functional People Team partners to execute program logistics end-to-end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather and analyze feedback from various sources to assess program effectiveness and contribute actionable recommendations for future iterations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain documentation for new and existing processes to ensure scalability and clear communication across stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience managing a project from initial concept to completion, including setting timelines and tracking deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical and problem-solving capability with a data-driven approach to decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organizational skills sufficient to balance multiple priorities and meet deadlines in a remote environment without close oversight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written and verbal communication with the ability to collaborate effectively across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
