&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;Learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;fortidlp-input-element-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Coinbase is building the infrastructure for an open financial system. As Accounting Manager, Global GL Operations, you will own end-to-end global close activities and lead core GL operations across corporate OpEx, operating cash, capitalized software, and intercompany accounting. You will play a pivotal role in scaling our systems, strengthening internal controls, and collaborating with Product, Engineering, FP&amp;amp;A, Treasury, and Tax to turn complex product launches into close-ready operational processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead month-end and quarter-end close activities across global entities, including journal entries, reconciliations, account analysis, and consolidated reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own accounting operations for corporate OpEx, including accruals, reclasses, recurring entries, and variance analysis in partnership with FP&amp;amp;A and Source-to-Pay.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee operating cash reconciliations, aging of reconciling items, and close-related partnership with Treasury.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide accounting for capitalized software, including capitalization assessments, asset additions, amortization, and related controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee intercompany processes, including routine billings, shared-services recharges, cash settlement support, eliminations, and foreign-currency considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Engineering, Finance Systems, FP&amp;amp;A, Tax, Treasury, Legal, and Payroll to support new products, market expansion, and scalable accounting processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen the close through automation, SOX-compliant controls, clear documentation, audit readiness, and effective leadership of accounting team members and BPO partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Required Skills and Experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;9+ years of progressive accounting or finance experience, including experience leading or managing a team, FTEs, or BPO resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Accounting, Finance, or a related field; CPA or equivalent professional accounting qualification preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience leading multi-entity month-end close, including journal entries, reconciliations, accruals, variance analysis, and consolidated reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of U.S. GAAP, SOX controls, and accounting process documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience across several of the following: operating expenses, cash reconciliations, capitalized software, intercompany accounting, consolidations, or foreign-currency accounting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to improve accounting processes, partner cross-functionally on product or market expansion, and exercise sound judgment in ambiguous situations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with an ERP system such as NetSuite, Oracle, or SAP; strong spreadsheet skills and responsible AI fluency, with SQL or analytics-tool experience a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
